  "answer": "You cannot directly delete photos from your phone without also deleting them from iCloud when using iCloud Photo Library, because it syncs all devices. Instead, enable 'Optimize iPhone Storage' in Settings > iCloud > Photos to keep smaller versions on your phone while full-resolution originals remain in iCloud. Alternatively, use a third-party service like Dropbox to back up photos before deleting them from your phone.",
